@startuml
title 1024-bit GPU Datapath (Skeleton)

actor "Host" as Host

component "Control Memory\nmemory[]" as CM
component "Dispatch PC\npc" as PC
component "Work-item Scheduler\nwork_items/current_wi" as SCH
component "Decoder (Placeholder)" as DEC
component "Vector ALU\n(copy/add helpers)" as VALU
component "Vector Register File\nvregfile" as VRF

Host --> CM : load control/kernel program
PC --> CM : fetch qword
CM --> DEC : opcode
DEC --> SCH : setup work-items (placeholder)
SCH --> VALU : execute kernel per work-item
VALU --> VRF : read/write vectors (1024-bit limbs)
DEC --> PC : update pc / halt

note right of VALU
Implemented helpers (so far):
- copy_vreg_1024
- add_vreg_1024
Current opcodes:
- VCOPY
- VADD
end note
@enduml

